            "body": "\r\n\r\nSo the `Yanked_value` below is a current yanked value in my running Nvim instance.\r\n\r\nTest result:\r\n```\r\nFails (1) and Notes (0)\r\nFAIL in tests/test_apis.lua | copy_apex_name() | return apex name:\r\n  Failed expectation for equality.\r\n  Left:  \"Yanked_value\"\r\n  Right: \"SfProject\"\r\n  Traceback:\r\n    tests/test_apis.lua:69\r\n\r\nmake: *** [Makefile:3: test] Error 1\r\n```",
